{"v": 4, "paragraphs": ["Famosos chegaram para o primeiro treino livre de Fórmula 1 em Interlagos nesta sexta-feira (6). Joaquim Huck, Fred Bruno, João Gomes, Felipe Massa e Paulo André foram fotografados antes de assistirem a performance dos pilotos na pista antes do valendo.", "Esse treino serve para ajustar os carros e ver se está tudo certo para a próxima etapa da programação do Grande Prêmio, que acontece no domingo (8); veja fotos."], "images": ["https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/7_aurtvVkr7rgGdT3cAjtYmjrV8=/1600x0/filters:format(jpeg)/https://i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/0/Q/5nLII3Rx6Uef8AfKBnGA/whatsapp-image-2026-11-06-at-13.29.17.jpeg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/iBKQVubPXlzKnZM8b1CNoAzrFDY=/0x0:1857x2790/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/m/x/9WXlcBRG6bvkqL4OHA3A/edu0973.jpg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/6ZRM7v6C-cpdGP9HelvOynSJHNI=/0x0:3280x2183/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/r/e/n3KBc7RXGjr9LqfsFVJg/edu0880.jpg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/qiFxJ_gi55mUGwiop6Q_WqTCYY8=/0x0:3904x2598/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/5/2/2ipqTWQhOdPjYNJAsH7A/edu0986.jpg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/r4h4jNmjQmR1EcBhzZjFUIGv9qY=/0x0:1727x2594/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/c/J/QyAJzQQYAZl4eWD4zgnA/edu1005.jpg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/blpOqgJEAy8LKEF2b2sVANORB2I=/0x0:2228x3347/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/c/l/IO9TBpQHinyFBJkHri1g/edu1011.jpg"], "videos": []}